linux-cachyos-surface
======================

This repository is a fork of linux-surface/linux-surface. It exists to add a
CachyOS kernel packaging (`pkg/linux-cachyos-surface/PKGBUILD`) on top of that
project's patches, so the resulting kernel can be tracked and built with
`makepkg`/pacman like any other package.

Credit and thanks:

  - linux-surface/linux-surface (https://github.com/linux-surface/linux-surface)
    -- GPL-2.0. All the Microsoft Surface hardware-enablement patches this
    kernel is built from originate here. This repo is a fork of theirs and
    tracks their patches directly; they are the only external upstream this
    packaging depends on.

  - CachyOS/linux-cachyos (https://github.com/CachyOS/linux-cachyos) and
    CachyOS/linux (https://github.com/CachyOS/linux) -- the CachyOS kernel
    base (EEVDF/BORE scheduler, BBR3, LTO, and other CachyOS patches/tuning)
    this build starts from, and the packaging conventions
    (`pkg/linux-cachyos-surface/PKGBUILD`'s build-option scaffolding) this
    PKGBUILD is adapted from.

